    "updated_at": "2021-12-07T20:01:46Z",
    "body": "I found out what the job is in my case:\r\n\r\n`wezterm set-working-directory 2> /dev/null`\r\n\r\nI have no idea how this got in here. My `~/.bashrc` is just the contents of `starship init bash --print-full-init`, and my `~/.bash_profile` and `~/.profile` are empty. Is this a bug on WezTerm?",
